# Script pack for spec-symphony remote runner.

Pack directory: `${specsym_pack_dir}` on runner host `${shell_work_home}`.

Shell tool prefix: `${shell_tool_prefix}_execute_series`.

Version: ${script_pack_version}.

Subcommands (via stage-runner.sh): clone, spec-bootstrap, validate, commit-pr, archive.

Always set SPECSYM_ALLOW_DIRECT=1 and run pack ensure before stage-runner.
